@code{Source.OpSrc("*", listOf(Source.RegSrc("n"), Source.RegSrc("val")))}).
@end itemize

Extend the machine with accessors that provide this new information.  To test
your analyzer, define the Fibonacci machine from @ref{Figure 5.12} and examine
the lists you constructed.
@end quotation

